# Vendored PKGBUILD (Story 2.47) — maintained in this repo, not from the AUR.
# Upstream: https://github.com/powerline/fonts (OFL-1.1 for Source Code Pro).
# The polybar themes declare "Source Code Pro for Powerline" (font-0); no repo
# package ships the powerline-patched families (extra's powerline-fonts is
# only PowerlineSymbols.otf), so this vendors the 14 SourceCodePro OTFs pinned
# to a commit with per-file checksums. Never declare this name in a metapac
# group; tools/custom-pkgs + bootstrap 6d own install and the IgnorePkg pin.
#
# Upstream is frozen (last commit 2024-03-22, no releases) — nothing to watch:
# custom-pkgs: no-watch
_commit=a029626780dd4af32f15a3e708a5b00528c22f1d
